{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 4490.0, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Decide on continuation direction", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "E139 PX4 Discourse view-count matched-harvest experiment: 150 topics harvested from discuss.px4.io, classified with developer-forum-specific classifier. Results: G1 PASS (100% have view_count > 0), G2 FAIL (58.7% coverage < 60% threshold), G3 FAIL (70.86% unserved fraction upper bound > 60%), G4 PASS (150 topics). Cliff's delta 0.0411 (negligible effect, Mann-Whitney p=0.6704). No candidate generated. Experiment contributes evidence on view-count principle domain-dependence: arrival metric generalizes but coverage boundary and zero-reply metric are domain-specific. Key files produced in EXPERIMENTS/139-px4-discourse-viewcount-matched/: PROTOCOL.md, RESULT.md, fetch_px4.py, classify_px4.py, measure_px4.py, gates.json, results_raw.json, classified.json. Next: evaluate whether to improve classifier coverage, investigate forum differences, or move to new opportunity.", "unlogged_changes": 24}, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 28, "session": "2026-10-14-004-run-e142-valueset-py-unchanged-on-regula", "ts": "2026-10-14T15:20:51+00:00"}
